# Audio stack, loaded by rog5-audio.service after Wi-Fi and Bluetooth.
# Loaded at boot (r39) the q6asm DAIs took an apps SMMU context ahead of the
# PCIe Wi-Fi function and ath11k's MHI power-up timed out (-110), the same
# failure QUP wrapper 2 caused at boot. The CS35L45 amplifiers sit on wrapper 2
# and only appear once rog5_bt_activate enables it, so nothing is lost by
# loading late. One module per line, as in boot-modules.
apr
q6core
q6afe_dai
q6afe_clocks
q6asm_dai
q6routing
pinctrl_sc7280_lpass_lpi
snd_soc_cs35l45_i2c
snd_soc_sm8250
